        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "? 列"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A backup is written to ~/Library/Application Support/MacToys/Hosts before every change.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次更改前都会将备份写入 ~/Library/Application Support/MacToys/Hosts。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次變更前都會將備份寫入 ~/Library/Application Support/MacToys/Hosts。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A brief notice with what was copied, or that no text was found.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "简短提示拷贝了什么内容，或者未找到文本。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "顯示簡短通知，說明拷貝了什麼內容，或未找到文字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A circle that follows the pointer. Transparent turns it off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跟随指针的圆圈。选择“透明”即可关闭。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跟隨指標的圓圈。設為透明即可關閉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A cup that shows the current mode, with the Awake menu.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示当前模式的杯子图标，附带 Awake 菜单。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "顯示目前模式的杯子圖像，附有 Awake 選單。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A direct alias works as soon as it’s typed; otherwise type it followed by a space": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "直接别名在键入后立即生效；否则请在键入后再加一个空格"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "直接別名在輸入後立即生效；否則請在輸入後加上空格"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A file's type comes from its extension. Extensions macOS doesn't know (.rs, .go, .kt…) are declared by MacToys; another app declaring them differently wins for its own files.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件的类型取决于其扩展名。macOS 无法识别的扩展名（.rs、.go、.kt…）由 MacToys 声明；如果其他 App 对其有不同的声明，该 App 自己的文件以其声明为准。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "檔案類型取決於其副檔名。macOS 不認得的副檔名（.rs、.go、.kt⋯）由 MacToys 宣告；若其他 App 以不同方式宣告，該 App 自己的檔案會以其宣告為準。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A format with this name already exists.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已存在同名格式。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已有使用此名稱的格式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A frozen picture to copy, save or drag into another app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "定格的画面，可以拷贝、存储或拖到其他 App 中。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "凍結的畫面，可拷貝、儲存或拖移到其他 App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A global shortcut that runs a command without opening the palette, or opens straight into its page.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无需打开面板即可运行命令或直接打开其页面的全局快捷键。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全域快速鍵，不必打開面板即可執行指令，或直接打開其頁面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A high-level name such as “Light Green”, “Green” or “Dark Green”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "概括性的名称，例如“浅绿色”、“绿色”或“深绿色”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "概略名稱，例如「淺綠色」、「綠色」或「深綠色」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A key": {
      "comment": "Remap kind: remap a single key",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按键"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按鍵"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A key can’t be remapped to itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按键不能重映射到其自身。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按鍵無法重新對應至自身。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A keyword runs only that plugin: “%@”, “%@”. Characters used in math or paths (%@) can clash with global results.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "A keyword runs only that plugin: “%1$@”, “%2$@”. Characters used in math or paths (%3$@) can clash with global results."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关键字只运行对应的插件：“%1$@”、“%2$@”。数学或路径中使用的字符（%3$@）可能与全局结果冲突。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "關鍵字只會執行該外掛程式：「%1$@」、「%2$@」。用於數學或路徑的字元（%3$@）可能與全域結果衝突。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A link or another app asked to run this command. Continue only if you expected it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "某个链接或其他 App 请求运行此命令。仅在你预期如此时才继续。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有連結或其他 App 要求執行此指令。請只在你預期如此時才繼續。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A magnified, live view you can keep working in. ⌃⌥= and ⌃⌥- change the level.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "放大的实时画面，你可以继续在其中操作。⌃⌥= 和 ⌃⌥- 可更改缩放级别。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "放大的即時畫面，你可以繼續在其中工作。⌃⌥= 和 ⌃⌥- 可更改縮放程度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A page with the document's headings and text": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "包含文稿标题和文本的页面"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "包含文件標題與文字的頁面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A preview of all displays: click to move the pointer there. 1–9 pick a display, ← → cycle, Home/End first/last, P primary.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有显示器的预览：点按即可将指针移到那里。1–9 选择显示器，← → 循环切换，Home/End 切换到第一个/最后一个，P 切换到主显示器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有顯示器的預覽：按一下即可將指標移到該處。1–9 選擇顯示器，← → 循環切換，Home/End 第一台/最後一台，P 主顯示器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quick launcher with plugin keywords: = calculator, > shell, // URLs, < windows and more.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "带插件关键字的快速启动器：= 计算器、> shell、// URL、< 窗口等。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用外掛程式關鍵字的快速啟動器：= 計算機、> shell、// URL、< 視窗等。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
