    "Fill covers the size and crops the rest, Fit keeps the whole picture inside it, Stretch distorts it to the exact size. Leave width or height empty to keep the proportions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“填充”会铺满该尺寸并裁掉多余部分，“适应”会将整张图片保留在该尺寸内，“拉伸”会将其变形为精确尺寸。将宽度或高度留空即可保持比例。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「填滿」會覆蓋整個大小並裁切多餘部分，「符合」會將整張圖片保留在範圍內，「延展」會將圖片變形成精確的大小。將寬度或高度留白即可維持比例。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fill the fields with the last search and replacement.": {
