      "comment": "Break timer background: a plain dark screen\nDetail row value: the script takes no argument\nImage Resizer: no TIFF compression\nLayout editor: no quick-apply key\nNo desktop picture chosen\nNo file chosen\nPowerRename text format: no case change\nScreen Ruler default mode: no tool selected\nSunrise or sunset offset of zero minutes",
