        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "结果太大"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "結果太大"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The screen couldn't be captured": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法截取屏幕"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法擷取螢幕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The slicer's embedded image when there is one, otherwise the toolpath": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如有切片软件内嵌的图像则使用该图像，否则使用刀具路径"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有切片軟體內嵌影像時使用該影像，否則使用刀具路徑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The slow sweep for fine positioning.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用于精细定位的慢速扫描。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用於精細定位的慢速掃描。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The smaller number of a size applies to the smaller side of each picture.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尺寸中较小的数值适用于每张图片的较短边。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "大小中較小的數字會套用到每張圖片較短的一邊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The template “%@” no longer exists": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模板“%@”已不存在"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "範本「%@」已不存在"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The templates folder is empty.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模板文件夹为空。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "範本檔案夾是空的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tool that's selected when the toolbar opens.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工具栏打开时选中的工具。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打開工具列時選取的工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The toolbar opens after you hold the letter alone; the letter is replaced only if you choose a character.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "单独按住字母后工具栏才会打开；只有选取字符时才会替换该字母。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "單獨按住字母後工具列就會打開；只有在你選擇字元時才會取代該字母。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The window under the pointer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指针下方的窗口。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指標下方的視窗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The zone a window will drop into": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "窗口将要放入的区域"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "視窗將放入的區域"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their servers can tell when you preview a document": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图像所在的服务器可以得知你何时预览了文稿"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "影像的伺服器可以得知你何時預覽文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主题"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主題"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no preview for this kind of file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此类文件没有预览。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此類檔案沒有預覽。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There's no shortcut: open the editor from the MacToys menu, Settings or `open mactoys://hosts`. The file is saved as UTF-8 without a byte order mark, as macOS expects.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有快捷键：可从 MacToys 菜单、设置或 `open mactoys://hosts` 打开编辑器。文件按 macOS 的要求存储为不带字节顺序标记的 UTF-8。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有快速鍵：請從 MacToys 選單、「設定」或 `open mactoys://hosts` 打開編輯器。檔案會依 macOS 的要求儲存為不含位元組順序記號的 UTF-8。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They only read their preferences at launch, so a written domain shows after a relaunch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它们只在启动时读取偏好设置，因此写入的域会在重新启动后才显示效果。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這些 App 只會在啟動時讀取偏好設定，因此寫入的網域要在重新啟動後才會顯示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They stay with you like Picture in Picture, also over full-screen apps": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它们会像画中画一样跟随你，也会显示在全屏幕 App 之上"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它們會像子母畫面一樣跟著你，也能顯示在全螢幕 App 上方"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thickness": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "粗细"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "粗細"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Mac"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This binary G-code file couldn't be decoded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法解码此二进制 G-code 文件。"
