            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此資料庫沒有表格。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This document": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此文稿"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This document has dates or data, which JSON can't hold.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此文稿包含 JSON 无法存储的日期或数据。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此文件包含日期或資料，而 JSON 無法儲存這些內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This document hasn't been saved yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此文稿尚未存储。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此文件尚未儲存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This group’s key": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此组的密钥"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此群組的密鑰"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This ignores your monitors' capability strings and probes every control directly, with slower timing. Only use it if a monitor is missing.\n\n• The screen may briefly go black or lose signal.\n• The monitor may change brightness, contrast or input unexpectedly.\n• The monitor may stop answering DDC/CI until it's power-cycled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会忽略显示器的功能字符串，并以较慢的速度直接探测每个控制项。仅在缺少某台显示器时使用。\n\n• 屏幕可能会短暂变黑或失去信号。\n• 显示器可能会意外更改亮度、对比度或输入源。\n• 显示器可能会停止响应 DDC/CI，直到重新通电。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這會忽略顯示器的功能字串，並以較慢的時序直接探測每個控制項。請只在有顯示器未被偵測到時使用。\n\n• 螢幕可能會短暫變黑或失去訊號。\n• 顯示器可能會意外更改亮度、對比或輸入。\n• 顯示器可能會停止回應 DDC/CI，直到重新開關電源為止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This isn't a property list (XML, binary or OpenStep) or JSON file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这不是属性列表（XML、二进制或 OpenStep）或 JSON 文件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這不是屬性列表（XML、二進位或 OpenStep）或 JSON 檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This isn't a valid STL file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这不是有效的 STL 文件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這不是有效的 STL 檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This media file can't be exported (it may be protected).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法导出此媒体文件（它可能受保护）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法輸出此媒體檔案（可能受到保護）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This monitor didn't report a capabilities string; its controls were found by probing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此显示器未报告功能字符串；其控制项是通过探测找到的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此顯示器未回報功能字串；其控制項是透過探測找到的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This replaces every setting of the domain with this document (defaults import). Apps using it may need to be relaunched.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会用此文稿替换该域的所有设置（defaults import）。使用该域的 App 可能需要重新启动。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這會以此文件取代該網域的所有設定（defaults import）。使用該網域的 App 可能需要重新啟動。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This window can't be pinned": {
      "localizations": {
